# netavark shells out to the nft/iptables binaries at runtime to program
# networks. The same packaging builds netavark 1.x (iptables) and 2.x
# (nftables); depend on both so every track works out of the box.
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, nftables, iptables
Description: OCI container network stack
 Netavark is the container network stack used by Podman 4.4 and newer,
 replacing CNI. Required by Podman 6.
